-    $$ p(\mathbf{b}, t_{dc} \mid \Xi) = p(t_{cb}, \boldsymbol{\omega}_{cb}, t_{dc} \mid \Xi) G(\mathbf{b}, \mathbf{c}) \quad \text{(Eq. 9)} $$
