-    The measure change for sampling $\mathbf{b}$ as a distance and direction from $\mathbf{a}$ is:
-    $$ p(\mathbf{b}, t_{dc} \mid \Xi) = p(t_{ab}, \boldsymbol{\omega}_{ab}, t_{dc} \mid \Xi) G(\mathbf{a}, \mathbf{b}) \quad \text{(Eq. 13)} $$
